00:13:38.768 --> 00:13:41.340
What did we learn during the pandemic?

00:13:41.340 --> 00:13:44.070
That very often things
never go as planned.

00:13:44.070 --> 00:13:47.026
- What happens if you
embrace the complexity

00:13:47.026 --> 00:13:51.660
